lection script\" id=\"opportunity-label\">\n                                    Threshold met · sample rule ≥55\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-[8px] border border-[var(--line-soft)] bg-[#0e1216] px-3 py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"scores helper box\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-info text-[12px] text-[#98a2a9]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"info icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <p class=\"text-[10px] leading-[1.6] text-[#9da7ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"info text\">\n                                DexScreener enrichment may provide market figures; it does not certify a token’s on-chain safety.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border-t border-[var(--line)] px-4 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"market data section\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"market data header\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#e6ebed]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"market data title\">\n                                Market data\n                            </h3>\n                            <span class=\"dr-mono text-[9px] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"market data source\">\n                                Sample snapshot · values are illustrative\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 rounded-[9px] border border-[var(--line-soft)] bg-[#0e1216]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"market grid\">\n                            <div class=\"market-cell px-3 py-3 sm:px-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"price cell\">\n                                <p class=\"dr-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"price label\">\n                                    Price · USD\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"dr-mono mt-2 text-[14px] font-medium text-[#e7ebed]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"price value\" data-reason=\"text updated by selection script\" id=\"market-price\">\n                                    $0.00318\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"market-cell px-3 py-3 sm:px-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"market cap cell\">\n                                <p class=\"dr-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"market cap label\">\n                                    Market cap\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"dr-mono mt-2 text-[14px] font-medium text-[#e7ebed]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"market cap value\" data-reason=\"text updated by selection script\" id=\"market-cap\">\n                                    $1.82M\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"market-cell px-3 py-3 sm:px-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"liquidity cell\">\n                                <p class=\"dr-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"liquidity label\">\n                                    Liquidity\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"dr-mono mt-2 text-[14px] font-medium text-[#e7ebed]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"liquidity value\" data-reason=\"text updated by selection script\" id=\"market-liquidity\">\n                                    $184K\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border-t border-[var(--line)] px-4 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"related alerts section\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"alerts header\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"alerts title block\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#e6ebed]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"alerts title\">\n                                    Related alerts\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"alerts description\">\n                                    Events associated with this selection\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"dr-mono rounded border border-[var(--line)] px-2 py-1 text-[9px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"alerts badge\">\n                                SAMPLE\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-[9px] border border-[var(--line-soft)] bg-[#0e1216] px-3.5 py-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"alert entry\" data-reason=\"content updated by selection script\" id=\"alert-entry\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"alert content\">\n                                <span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#b8a0ee]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"alert bullet\">\n                                </span>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"alert text info\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#dce2e4]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"alert title text\" data-reason=\"text updated by selection script\" id=\"alert-title\">\n                                        Opportunity threshold met\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"dr-mono mt-1 text-[9px] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"alert meta text\" data-reason=\"text updated by selection script\" id=\"alert-meta\">\n                                        Score 67 · sample alert\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"dr-mono pl-4 text-[9px] text-[var(--quiet)] sm:pl-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"alert timestamp\">\n                                14:32:16 · sample\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border-t border-[var(--line)] px-4 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5\" data-name=\"continue section\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"continue header\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#e6ebed]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"continue title\">\n                                Continue with external tools\n                            </h3>\n                            <span class=\"text-[9px] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"continue help\">\n                                Opens another site\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"continue links grid\">\n                            <a class=\"focus-ring flex min-h-10 items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-[8px] border border-[#596745] bg-[#20271e] px-3 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#d6e8c2] hover:bg-[#293427]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"jupiter link\" data-reason=\"href updated by selection script\" href=\"https://jup.ag/swap/SOL-2zMMhcVQEXDtdE6VsFSZY4xF6rYzGzCzE6w2ttv7Z9w\" id=\"jupiter-link\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"jupiter label\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"jupiter icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Open in Jupiter\n                                </span>\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-external-link text-[11px] text-[#91a081]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2-1-2\" data-name=\"jupiter external icon\">\n                                </i>\n                            </a>\n                            <a class=\"focus-ring flex min-h-10 items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-[8px] border border-[var(--line)] bg-[#141a20] px-3 text-[10px] font-medium text-[#d2d9dc] hover:border-[#43505a]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"dexscreener link\" data-reason=\"href updated by selection script\" href=\"https://dexscreener.com/solana/2zMMhcVQEXDtdE6VsFSZY4xF6rYzGzCzE6w2ttv7Z9w\" id=\"dex-link\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"dexscreener label\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-chart-no-axes-column-increasing text-[12px] text-[#b5a2f2]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"dexscreener icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    View on DexScreener\n                                </span>\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-external-link text-[11px] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"dexscreener external icon\">\n                                </i>\n                            </a>\n                            <a class=\"focus-ring flex min-h-10 items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-[8px] border border-[var(--line)] bg-[#141a20] px-3 text-[10px] font-medium text-[#d2d9dc] hover:border-[#43505a]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2-3\" data-name=\"solscan link\" data-reason=\"href updated by selection script\" href=\"https://solscan.io/token/2zMMhcVQEXDtdE6VsFSZY4xF6rYzGzCzE6w2ttv7Z9w\" id=\"solscan-link\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2-3-1\" data-name=\"solscan label\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-shield-question-mark text-[12px] text-[#9dac9f]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"solscan icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Verify on Solscan\n                                </span>\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-external-link text-[11px] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-2-3-2\" data-name=\"solscan external icon\">\n                                </i>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[740px] text-[10px] leading-[1.65] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-5-3\" data-name=\"disclaimer text\">\n                            Scores are triage signals, not a promise of safety or returns. Review current information at the destination before acting. Figures, timestamps and activity shown in this concept are sample data.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n            <footer class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 border-t border-[var(--line-soft)] pt-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"page footer\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"footer identity\">\n                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-4 w-4 text-[#a7c087]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"footer icon\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n                        <path d=\"M3 7V4h3m8 0h3v3m0 6v3h-3m-8 0H3v-3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.3\">\n                        </path>\n                        <path d=\"M3 10h5m4 0h5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\">\n                        </path>\n                        <circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\" r=\"1.7\">\n                        </circle>\n                    </svg>\n                    <span class=\"dr-mono text-[9px] tracking-[.1em] text-[#9ca7a4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"footer brand text\">\n                        DEGENRADAR\n                        <span class=\"text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"footer sub-brand\">\n                            / SOLANA TOKEN INTELLIGENCE\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"dr-mono text-[9px] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"footer disclaimer\">\n                    Demo workspace · Review source state before deployment\n                </span>\n            </footer>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n    (() => {\n  const app = document.getElementById('workspace');\n  if (!app) return;\n  const rows = [...app.querySelectorAll('.radar-row')];\n  const search = app.querySelector('#token-search');\n  const empty = app.querySelector('#no-results');\n  const count = app.querySelector('#result-count');\n  let filter = 'all';\n  const symbols = new Set();\n  const updateVisible = () => {\n    const q = (search.value || '').toLowerCase().trim();\n    let visible = 0;\n    rows.forEach(row => {\n      const matchesText = !q || `${row.dataset.symbol} ${row.dataset.name} ${row.dataset.mint}`.toLowerCase().includes(q);\n      const matchesFilter = filter === 'all' || row.dataset[`filter${filter[0].toUpperCase()}${filter.slice(1)}`] === 'true';\n      const show = matchesText && matchesFilter;\n      row.classList.toggle('hidden', !show);\n      if (show) visible++;\n    });\n    count.textContent = String(visible).padStart(2, '0');\n    empty.classList.toggle('hidden', visible > 0);\n  };\n  const selectRow = (row) => {\n    rows.forEach(item => { item.classList.toggle('selected', item === row); item.setAttribute('aria-pressed', item === row ? 'true' : 'false'); });\n    app.querySelector('#detail-symbol').textContent = `$${row.dataset.symbol}`;\n    app.querySelector('#detail-name').textContent = row.dataset.name;\n    app.querySelector('#detail-token-mark').textContent = row.dataset.symbol[0];\n    app.querySelector('#detail-mint').textContent = row.dataset.mint;\n    const risk = row.dataset.risk;\n    const opp = row.dataset.opportunity;\n    app.querySelector('#risk-number').textContent = risk || '—';\n    app.querySelector('#risk-label').textContent = row.dataset.riskLabel;\n    app.querySelector('#risk-meter').style.width = risk ? `${risk}%` : '0%';\n    app.querySelector('#opportunity-number').textContent = opp || '—';\n    app.querySelector('#opportunity-label').textContent = row.dataset.opLabel;\n    app.querySelector('#opportunity-meter').style.width = opp ? `${opp}%` : '0%';\n    app.querySelector('#market-price').textContent = row.dataset.price;\n    app.querySelector('#market-cap').textContent = row.dataset.cap;\n    app.querySelector('#market-liquidity').textContent = row.dataset.liquidity;\n    app.querySelector('#alert-title').textContent = row.dataset.alert;\n    app.querySelector('#alert-meta').textContent = row.dataset.alertMeta;\n    const mint = row.dataset.mint;\n    app.querySelector('#jupiter-link').href = `https://jup.ag/swap/SOL-${mint}`;\n    app.querySelector('#dex-link').href = `https://dexscreener.com/solana/${mint}`;\n    app.querySelector('#solscan-link').href = `https://solscan.io/token/${mint}`;\n    if (window.matchMedia('(max-width: 1023px)').matches) app.classList.add('mobile-inspecting');\n  };\n  rows.forEach(row => row.addEventListener('click', () => selectRow(row)));\n  search.addEventListener('input', updateVisible);\n  app.querySelectorAll('.filter-chip').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    filter = button.dataset.filter;\n    app.querySelectorAll('.filter-chip').forEach(chip => { chip.className = 'filter-chip focus-ring rounded-md border border-transparent px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--line)]'; });\n    button.className = 'filter-chip focus-ring rounded-md border border-[#546044] bg-[#232c22] px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-[#d9e9c7]';\n    updateVisible();\n  }));\n  app.querySelector('#mobile-back').addEventListener('click', () => app.classList.remove('mobile-inspecting'));\n  app.querySelector('#scan-mint').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const feedback = app.querySelector('#scan-feedback');\n    const value = search.value.trim();\n    feedback.textContent = value.length >= 32 && value.length <= 44 ? 'Sample mode · scan request queued for review' : 'Paste a full Solana mint address to start a scan.';\n  });\n  app.querySelector('#copy-mint').addEventListener('click', async () => {\n    const mint = app.querySelector('#detail-mint').textContent;\n    const feedback = app.querySelector('#copy-feedback');\n    try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(mint); feedback.textContent = 'Copied'; setTimeout(() => feedback.textContent = '', 1600); }\n    catch { feedback.textContent = 'Copy unavailable'; }\n  });\n  app.querySelector('#sort-button').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    app.querySelector('#scan-feedback').textContent = 'Sorted by opportunity score · sample ordering';\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
